<title>GERMANY: Bundesbank data show reserves steady on the week.</title>
<headline>Bundesbank data show reserves steady on the week.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bundesbank data released on Tuesday show net currency reserves were unchanged at 98.6 billion marks in the week ending August 15 from the week ending August 7. The Bundesbank provided the following reserve data:</p>
<p>(in billion marks)</p>
<p> Banking week ended		    Aug 15	  Aug 7</p>
<p> Gross currency reserves	     114.6	   114.6</p>
<p> Foreign liabilities		   16.0	    16.0</p>
<p>--Scott Miller, Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
